        {
          "text": "**U.S. Space Policy:** The political motivations behind major space projects, from Apollo's race to the Moon to the modern Artemis program.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 110,
          "source": "topic-set-the-space-shuttle-program-🆔20251106222620.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The *Mir*-Shuttle Program:** A focused look at the first phase of U.S.-Russian space collaboration, which served as the diplomatic and technical precursor to the ISS.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 110,
          "source": "topic-set-the-space-shuttle-program-🆔20251106222620.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**The Commercial Crew Program:** A deeper dive into the specific NASA program that funded SpaceX's Crew Dragon and Boeing's Starliner, exploring the shift from government-owned to commercially-operated vehicles.",
          "indent_level": 1,
          "line_number": 112,
          "source": "topic-set-the-space-shuttle-program-🆔20251106222620.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Orbital Debris:** The \"so what\" of 60 years in space. This non-mathematical topic explores the environmental-like challenge of space junk, the risks it poses, and the strategies being developed to mitigate it.",
